flowchart TD
  subgraph IN [What shapes the prompt]
    direction TB
    R1[Design references<br/>visual description and images]
    R2[Your extra prompt]
    R3[Prompt writer instructions]
  end

  A[A moment in the chat] --> B[Prompt writer builds<br/>a scene prompt]
  IN --> B
  B --> C{When should it<br/>generate?}
  C -- Automatic --> D[Send to your<br/>image provider]
  C -- Ask first --> E[You review and edit<br/>the prompt first]
  C -- Manual --> G[You trigger it<br/>yourself]
  E --> D
  G --> D
  D --> H[Reference images passed in order<br/>character, persona, background]
  H --> I{Which backend?}
  I -- Self hosted --> I1[ComfyUI or Diffusers]
  I -- Cloud --> I2[OpenAI, Gemini, xAI,<br/>Stability, and more]
  I1 --> J[Image is rendered]
  I2 --> J
  J --> K[Appears inline in the chat<br/>and saved to your library]

  classDef accent fill:#14532d,stroke:#4ade80,color:#f0fdf4;
  class R1,R2,R3 accent;
